# SynqDrive Landing Page

Read `AGENTS.md` first. Binding decisions: `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Phase context: `docs/audits/`.

## Non-negotiable

- **No dead links** — expose nav items only when destinations exist (DEC-004, DEC-008).
- **Staged nav** — Platform anchors active; Solutions, Resources, Pricing deferred until real pages exist.
- **Manual product images** — do not capture, sync, or regenerate from the Product Repository unless the user explicitly asks (`assets/product/README.md`).
- **No invented claims** — capabilities, availability, KPIs, customers, compliance.
- **Static architecture** — no framework migration without explicit instruction.
- **Phase discipline** — P1.3 desktop nav, P1.4 mobile nav, P1.6 deploy only when approved.

## Accessibility (desktop nav)

Disclosure pattern with normal links. Not ARIA `menu` / `menuitem`. Arrow keys not required.

## Before merge or deploy

`npm run build` and `npm run qa` (with `npm run serve` running).

## Do not duplicate

Full rules live in `AGENTS.md` and `docs/DECISIONS.md`. Do not restate them at length here.
